Z||000000||bHooper||05-25-2000||02:34 PM||||....Whee!!!<P>Drove my GT to work today!!!!  Obviously, I am very excited  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">!<P>How relaxing... Everyone thought I was on prozac this morning... I was so calm and relaxed!  <P>In fact, I have allready put 60 miles on the thing today, driving around!<P>Runs good, does have an exhaust leak, and that weird scrapeing sound... but what the he{{!<P>BTW, we had a horific thunderstorm and high winds in Greensboro, today!  Blew down trees everywhere!  Most of the city is without power!  I would even use the term "Natural Disaster" to describe what happened!  Fortunately, the only thing that affected me was theat we lost power at work... so I got to go driving in my GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  House and home are OK!<BR>||||reg||1
