Z||000005||Patrick's Dad||05-25-2000||10:52 PM||||Biy, this is what I'm going to miss [See thread: Here she sits...:::Sigh:::]. Not that I won't kill (I've got an old Valiant with a 318 that's just about road worthy...), but it's special with the Fiero.<P>Some recent ones included a V8 F150, a Daytona Turbo, and a Ford Probe. I also chased a Firebird Formula. He was much quicker than me, especially beyond 30MPH, or so, but he liked the sound of my engine (And I likewise....).<P>Just wait a few years, I tell myself....<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||DJRice||05-26-2000||09:12 AM||||Heres a tip on your mystery scraping sound...<P>Check the dust shields on your rear brakes to make sure you didnt bend one enough to be touching the brake rotor.  <P>I had that problem after putting an engine back in....Just a thought.||||reg||1
